        "id": 2290509684,
        "content": "We have started to use [Cloudflare pages function](https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/functions/) in https://github.com/ubiquity/pay.ubq.fi/pull/226 . **cloudflare-deploy-action** does not support the deployment of pages function. It only deploys static files.\r\nFor pages functions to work, it is necessary to have functions files in a `functions` directory. This directory must be the one where we run `wrangler pages deploy`. It appears when this action runs the `wrangler pages deploy`, the current directory is not where the `functions` directory is present.\r\nFor this to work, the cloudflare-deploy-action needs some changes but it also must support whatever is working already in static-only projects.",
